==================================================

The application should be able to improve its engineering capabilities
through controlled changes.

It may:
- Analyze its own source code.
- Identify defects.
- Suggest architectural improvements.
- Generate candidate patches.
- Generate additional tests.
- Compare alternative implementations.
- Evaluate new plugins.
- Propose new agents.
